  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.77 Shawtown Pond. No person shall operate a petroleum-powered boat on the waters of Shawtown Pond in the town of Freedom.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES: 5-3-95 (formerly Saf-C 402.66); ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95; amd by #7534, eff 7-25-01; paragraphs (a) & (b) EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04, except for paragraph (c); ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.62); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.70) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
